<LegalLayout title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How and when HonorCart may earn affiliate commission."><h2>The plain-language disclosure</h2><p>HonorCart may earn a commission when a shopper activates an eligible offer in a session where no protected existing referral was detected. The shopper’s price should not increase because of that commission.</p><h2>Protected sessions</h2><p>When HonorCart recognizes an existing eligible affiliate referral, HonorCart stands down from monetization and earns $0 from that protected session. Coupon testing may continue only when it can be done without activating HonorCart attribution.</p><h2>Clear consent</h2><p>Before any future affiliate-backed offer is activated, the extension will disclose that HonorCart may earn a commission. Global, network, merchant, and offer-level controls can disable monetization.</p><h2>Current status</h2><p>HonorCart is in development. Current offers and financial dashboard figures are demonstrations and do not represent live affiliate earnings.</p></LegalLayout>
